3. EXCLUSIONS
-------------

  - The official 30-image debug set supplied by the competition organizers is
    NOT part of this dataset and must never be copied into it or referenced
    from meta.csv. It stays under data/official_debug/.
  - No image obtained from a closed or private source, or by bypassing a
    site's access restrictions, paywall, login wall, rate limits or
    robots.txt, is included.
  - No image whose license permits use but prohibits redistribution.


4. PRIVACY
----------

Faces are blurred or covered where individuals are identifiable and the
source's license or applicable privacy rules require it. If you believe an
image in this dataset infringes your rights or privacy, contact the project
team and it will be removed.


5. NO WARRANTY
--------------

This dataset is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
implied. The authors are not liable for any claim, damages or other liability
arising from the dataset or its use.
